{
  "name": "relocate-ambiguous",
  "domain": "project-management",
  "format": "task-graph",
  "description": "声明的图不在语料里，而同一个依赖边在**两张**图里同样成立 —— 跨图搬迁不唯一。P5 的第三级降级（relocated-unique）只有在唯一命中时才允许搬迁，这里正是它必须拒绝的场景：挑一张「看起来对」的图，等于替模型猜它指的是哪份计划。",
  "input": {
    "format": "task-graph",
    "payload": {
      "documents": [
        {
          "path": "project/team-a/plan.json",
          "type": "task-graph",
          "meta": {
            "bytes": 1024
          },
          "payload": {
            "tasks": [
              {
                "id": "T1",
                "title": "共享组件抽取",
                "owner": "alice",
                "estimateDays": 2,
                "status": "todo",
                "team": "alpha"
              },
              {
                "id": "T2",
                "title": "调用方改造",
                "owner": "alice",
                "estimateDays": 3,
                "status": "todo",
                "team": "alpha",
                "dependsOn": [
                  "T1"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "path": "project/team-b/plan.json",
          "type": "task-graph",
          "meta": {
            "bytes": 1024
          },
          "payload": {
            "tasks": [
              {
                "id": "T1",
                "title": "共享组件抽取",
                "owner": "bob",
                "estimateDays": 2,
                "status": "todo",
                "team": "beta"
              },
              {
                "id": "T2",
                "title": "调用方改造",
                "owner": "bob",
                "estimateDays": 3,
                "status": "todo",
                "team": "beta",
                "dependsOn": [
                  "T1"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "expect": {
    "candidates": 6,
    "paths": [
      "project/team-a/plan-t2-t1.json",
      "project/team-a/plan-task-t1.json",
      "project/team-a/plan-task-t2.json",
      "project/team-b/plan-t2-t1.json",
      "project/team-b/plan-task-t1.json",
      "project/team-b/plan-task-t2.json"
    ],
    "admitted": 6,
    "excludedByPredicate": {
      "binary": [],
      "secret": [],
      "deleted": [],
      "user-exclude": [],
      "extension": [],
      "default-path": [],
      "too-large": []
    },
    "bounded": true,
    "truncated": false,
    "bundleKeys": [
      "ws/alpha",
      "ws/beta"
    ]
  },
  "anchors": {
    "positive": [
      {
        "note": "声明指向的图名不在语料里，但这条边只在**一张**图里成立 —— 允许唯一搬迁，并在 detail 里说明搬到了哪。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/unknown/plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "task-edge",
            "from": "T2",
            "to": "T1"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/unknown/plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/team-a/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T1"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "T2",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T1"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "path": "project/team-b/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T3"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "anchored",
        "expectTier": "relocated-unique",
        "expectPath": "project/team-a/plan.json"
      }
    ],
    "negative": [
      {
        "note": "同一条边在两张语义不同的图里都成立（两个团队各有一份同样的改造计划）。此时「T2 依赖 T1」有两个同样成立的落点 —— 必须返回 relocation-ambiguous 并列出两个竞争者，绝不挑一个。注：两张图共享 T1/T2 这两个 id 本身**不是**拒绝的理由（每个团队的 plan 都有 T1），决定因素是声明在几张图里成立。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/unknown/plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "task-edge",
            "from": "T2",
            "to": "T1"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/unknown/plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/team-a/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T1"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "T2",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T1"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "path": "project/team-b/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T1"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "T2",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T1"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "relocation-ambiguous",
        "expectAmbiguousIn": [
          "project/team-a/plan.json#task-edge",
          "project/team-b/plan.json#task-edge"
        ]
      },
      {
        "note": "同一条边在两张语义不同的图里都成立（两个团队各有一份同样的改造计划）。两个落点同样成立就是「搬迁不唯一」，必须拒绝并列出两者 —— 绝不挑 id 字典序靠前的那张。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/unknown/plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "task-edge",
            "from": "T2",
            "to": "T1"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/unknown/plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/team-a/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T1"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "T2",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T1"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "path": "project/team-b/plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T1"
                  },
                  {
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T1"
                    ],
                    "id": "T2"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "relocation-ambiguous",
        "expectAmbiguousIn": [
          "project/team-a/plan.json#task-edge",
          "project/team-b/plan.json#task-edge"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}